description "Ewok Tribesman

^9Weapons:
- Bloody Paws ^9(Melee)
^2-- Hit: Lifesteal
^2-- RoF: 2x
^1-- Damage: .75x
- Shortspear ^9(Staff/Yellow Saber)
^2-- Hit: Lifesteal
^2-- Knockback: +.1
^2-- Spec Damage: 2.4x
^2-- Radius: 5u
^1-- Defense: No
^1-- Chain: 3
^1-- Length: 20u
- Shortbow ^9(T-21 1)
^2-- Hit: Push/stagger
^2-- RoF: 1.17x
^1-- Damage: .5x
^1-- Mag Reload
- Rock (12)
^2-- Damage: 5x
^2-- RoF: 1.17x
^1-- Sec Fire: No

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Assemble (2)
- Getup (2)
- Dexterity (1)
^1- Knockback Taken: 1.15x

Archers, stone chuckers, and spear wielders of diminutive stature. They thrive on ambushes and pack behavior."